            "stars": "★★★★★",
            "result": "First 70.3 · 5:42",
            "quote": "My first carbon tri bike. I'm not a pro — I just wanted to stop getting dropped on the bike leg. It fit out of the box once I used their sizing call, and I genuinely felt faster.",
