            "stars": "★★★★★",
            "result": "3rd AG · Olympic",
            "quote": "Honest take: assembly took me about an hour and the headset needed patience. But for the money there's nothing close. The SAGS cockpit let me get low without buying parts.",
            "name": "Dana R.",
            "context": "2nd season, Boulder CO",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
